<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kelainan Kongenital Orofasial & GIT Atas 🌸</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --pink-light: #ffe0ec;
    --pink-mid: #ffb3cc;
    --pink-soft: #ffd6e7;
    --pink-deep: #e8859c;
    --yellow-soft: #fff8dc;
    --yellow-mid: #ffe99a;
    --yellow-warm: #ffd060;
    --yellow-deep: #e6c050;
    --cream: #fffbf5;
    --text-dark: #3a2a2a;
    --text-mid: #6b4c54;
    --text-light: #9a7a84;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(232,133,156,0.15);
    --shadow-hover: 0 8px 32px rgba(232,133,156,0.25);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.7;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* FLOATING DECORATIONS */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    top: -100px; right: -100px;
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,179,204,0.3), transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  body::after {
    content: '';
    position: fixed;
    bottom: -100px; left: -100px;
    width: 350px; height: 350px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,233,154,0.3), transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* HEADER */
  .hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd6e7 0%, #fff8dc 50%, #ffe0ec 100%);
    padding: 60px 40px 50px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--pink-mid);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '🌸💛🌸💛🌸💛🌸';
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px; left: 0; right: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    opacity: 0.5;
    letter-spacing: 20px;
  }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--pink-mid);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 46px);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .hero h1 span { color: var(--pink-deep); }
  .hero p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
  }
  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .meta-chip {
    background: white;
    border: 2px solid var(--pink-mid);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-mid);
  }

  /* NAVIGATION */
  .nav-sticky {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--pink-soft);
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
  }
  .nav-btn {
    white-space: nowrap;
    background: var(--pink-soft);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 8px 18px;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-btn:hover, .nav-btn.active {
    background: var(--pink-deep);
    color: white;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* MAIN LAYOUT */
  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* SECTION */
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    scroll-margin-top: 70px;
  }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .section-icon {
    width: 48px; height: 48px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .icon-pink { background: var(--pink-soft); }
  .icon-yellow { background: var(--yellow-soft); }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }
  .section-title small {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-light);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* CARDS */
  .card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    border-color: var(--pink-soft);
  }
  .card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 5px; height: 100%;
    border-radius: 20px 0 0 20px;
  }
  .card-pink::before { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--pink-mid), var(--pink-deep)); }
  .card-yellow::before { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--yellow-mid), var(--yellow-deep)); }
  .card-purple::before { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d4b8e0, #a87bc0); }
  .card-green::before { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #b8e0c8, #6db88a); }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  /* INFO BOXES */
  .info-box {
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .info-pink { background: var(--pink-soft); border-left: 4px solid var(--pink-deep); }
  .info-yellow { background: var(--yellow-soft); border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow-warm); }
  .info-box strong { color: var(--text-dark); }

  /* MNEMONIC */
  .mnemonic-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-soft), var(--yellow-soft));
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px;
    margin: 24px 0;
    border: 2px dashed var(--pink-mid);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mnemonic-box .label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--pink-deep);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .mnemonic-big {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 36px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin: 8px 0;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
  }
  .mnemonic-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .mnemonic-item {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  .mnemonic-item span { color: var(--pink-deep); font-size: 18px; }

  /* TABLE */
  .nice-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 16px 0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .nice-table th {
    background: var(--pink-mid);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 12px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .nice-table td {
    padding: 11px 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0e8ec;
  }
  .nice-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .nice-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #fff5f8; }
  .nice-table tr:nth-child(odd) td { background: white; }

  /* CLASSIFICATION VISUAL */
  .tipe-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .tipe-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 18px 14px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 2px solid var(--pink-soft);
    transition: all 0.2s;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .tipe-card:hover { border-color: var(--pink-deep); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .tipe-letter {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: var(--pink-deep);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .tipe-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-mid); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .tipe-pct { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-dark); }
  .tipe-desc { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-light); margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4; }

  /* RULE OF TEN */
  .ten-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .ten-card {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--yellow-soft), #fffdf0);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 2px solid var(--yellow-mid);
  }
  .ten-num {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 48px;
    color: var(--yellow-deep);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .ten-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-mid); margin-top: 6px; }

  /* FLOW CHART */
  .flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 16px 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .flow-box {
    background: white;
    border: 2px solid var(--pink-mid);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 100px;
  }
  .flow-arrow {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--pink-deep);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* HIGHLIGHT CHIPS */
  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  .chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .chip-pink { background: var(--pink-soft); color: var(--pink-deep); }
  .chip-yellow { background: var(--yellow-soft); color: #b8900a; }
  .chip-danger { background: #ffe8e8; color: #d44; }
  .chip-success { background: #e8f5e9; color: #2e7d32; }

  /* SKDI BADGE */
  .skdi-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--pink-deep);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-left: 8px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  /* LISTS */
  .check-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .check-list li {
    padding: 8px 0 8px 32px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #f0e8ec;
  }
  .check-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .check-list li::before {
    content: '✿';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--pink-deep);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  /* CLINICAL REASONING */
  .cr-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f5, #fffef0);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    border: 2px solid var(--pink-mid);
    position: relative;
  }
  .cr-box::before {
    content: '🧠 Clinical Reasoning';
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px; left: 20px;
    background: var(--pink-deep);
    color: white;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .cr-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    margin: 12px 0;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .cr-num {
    width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pink-mid);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* QUIZ */
  .quiz-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5fa, #fffcf0);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 36px;
    border: 3px solid var(--pink-mid);
  }
  .quiz-section h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-dark);
  }
  .quiz-section > p {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .quiz-item {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    border: 2px solid var(--pink-soft);
  }
  .quiz-q-header {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .quiz-num {
    background: var(--pink-deep);
    color: white;
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .vignette {
    background: var(--pink-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--pink-deep);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .vignette strong { color: var(--pink-deep); }
  .options { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
  .options li { margin: 8px 0; }
  .option-btn {
    width: 100%;
    background: #fafafa;
    border: 2px solid #f0e8ec;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    text-align: left;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .option-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
    background: var(--pink-soft);
    border-color: var(--pink-mid);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .option-btn.correct {
    background: #e8f5e9;
    border-color: #66bb6a;
    color: #1b5e20;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .option-btn.wrong {
    background: #ffebee;
    border-color: #ef9a9a;
    color: #b71c1c;
  }
  .option-btn.reveal-correct {
    background: #e8f5e9;
    border-color: #66bb6a;
    color: #1b5e20;
  }
  .option-letter {
    width: 26px; height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--pink-mid);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .correct .option-letter { background: #66bb6a; color: white; }
  .wrong .option-letter { background: #ef9a9a; color: white; }
  .reveal-correct .option-letter { background: #66bb6a; color: white; }
  .explanation {
    margin-top: 16px;
    background: var(--yellow-soft);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--yellow-warm);
    display: none;
    animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;
  }
  .explanation.show { display: block; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  .explanation strong { color: #b8900a; }

  /* SCORE TRACKER */
  .score-bar {
    background: var(--pink-soft);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 20px 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .score-display { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--pink-deep); }
  .score-label { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 600; }
  .reset-btn {
    background: var(--pink-deep);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 13px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .reset-btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* KEY POINT ALERTS */
  .key-point {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--yellow-soft), #fffdf5);
    border: 2px solid var(--yellow-warm);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin: 16px 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .key-point .icon { font-size: 22px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .key-point p { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-dark); }

  /* EMBRYO TIMELINE */
  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 30px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 10px; top: 0; bottom: 0;
    width: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--pink-mid), var(--yellow-mid));
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .tl-item {
    position: relative;
    padding: 12px 0 12px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed #f0e8ec;
  }
  .tl-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .tl-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -24px; top: 18px;
    width: 14px; height: 14px;
    background: var(--pink-deep);
    border: 3px solid var(--pink-soft);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .tl-time {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--pink-deep);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .tl-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-mid); }

  /* DIAGNOSIS PATH */
  .dx-path {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .dx-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border: 2px solid var(--pink-soft);
  }
  .dx-icon {
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--pink-soft);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* FOOTER */
  footer {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pink-mid), var(--yellow-mid));
    padding: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-top: 60px;
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .ten-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .tipe-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .container { padding: 24px 14px; }
    .quiz-section { padding: 24px 18px; }
  }

  /* SMOOTH SCROLL */
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  /* PROGRESS */
  .progress-ring {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">📚 Modul Digestif · Bedah Anak</div>
  <h1>Kelainan Kongenital<br><span>Orofasial & GIT Atas</span></h1>
  <p>Rangkuman lengkap dr. Aji Prabowo, Sp.B, FICS — Untuk Ujian Blok & UKMPPD 🌸</p>
  <div class="hero-meta">
    <div class="meta-chip">🌸 3 Topik Utama</div>
    <div class="meta-chip">💛 SKDI Referensi</div>
    <div class="meta-chip">🧠 10 Soal Quiz</div>
    <div class="meta-chip">✨ Mnemonic</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- NAVIGATION -->
<div class="nav-sticky">
  <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="scrollTo('intro')">🌸 Pendahuluan</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollTo('clp')">👄 CLP / Bibir Sumbing</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollTo('mikro')">🦷 Mikro/Makrognatia</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollTo('ea')">🫁 Atresia Esofagus</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollTo('vacterl')">🔗 VACTERL</button>
  <button class="nav-btn" onclick="scrollTo('quiz')">❓ Quiz</button>
</div>

<div class="container">

  <!-- ══════════════════════ PENDAHULUAN ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="intro">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-icon icon-pink">🌸</div>
      <div class="section-title">
        <small>Overview</small>
        Pendahuluan Kelainan Kongenital
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>📌 Definisi & Epidemiologi</h3>
      <p style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:14px;"><strong>Kelainan kongenital</strong> adalah kelainan susunan tubuh yang mencolok yang terdapat pada bayi pada saat lahir. Insidensi: <strong>2–3%</strong> dari seluruh kelahiran hidup.</p>
      <div class="info-box info-yellow">
        <strong>⚠️ Penting:</strong> Beberapa kelainan baru terlihat setelah beberapa bulan/tahun (contoh: Hirschsprung bisa baru terdiagnosis usia 1–2 tahun). Tetap termasuk <em>kelainan kongenital</em>, bukan kelainan yang didapat!
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>🧬 5 Penyebab Penyakit Secara Umum</h3>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip chip-pink">🦠 Infeksi</span>
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">🧬 Kelainan Kongenital</span>
        <span class="chip chip-pink">🔬 Neoplasma (Tumor)</span>
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">💥 Trauma</span>
        <span class="chip chip-pink">⏳ Degeneratif</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:14px; margin-top:12px; color:var(--text-mid);">Hari ini kita fokus pada <strong>kelainan kongenital</strong> khususnya orofasial dan traktus digestifus atas.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>🔍 Etiologi — MULTIFAKTORIAL</h3>
      <p style="font-size:14px; margin-bottom:14px; color:var(--text-mid);">Tidak ada satu penyebab tunggal! Selalu multifaktorial:</p>
      <table class="nice-table">
        <tr><th>Faktor</th><th>Contoh</th></tr>
        <tr><td>🦠 Infeksi</td><td>Rubella, CMV, Herpes, Toksoplasma</td></tr>
        <tr><td>🏭 Lingkungan</td><td>Zat kimia, defisiensi nutrisi, radiasi</td></tr>
        <tr><td>💊 Obat Teratogenik</td><td>Metotreksat, Karbamazepin, Asam retinoat</td></tr>
        <tr><td>🧬 Genetik</td><td>Mutasi gen, kelainan kromosom saat pembentukan zigot</td></tr>
        <tr><td>👩 Faktor Ibu</td><td>Usia lanjut, trauma awal kehamilan, stres psikis</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="key-point">
      <div class="icon">💡</div>
      <p>Fase kritis terjadinya kelainan kongenital = <strong>Trimester I (minggu 1–12)</strong>. Pada fase ini terjadi organogenesis/diferensiasi sel. Obat apa pun harus SANGAT hati-hati diberikan pada ibu hamil di fase ini!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>🔬 Deteksi Prenatal — Mengapa Penting?</h3>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">📱 USG (non-invasif)</span>
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">🩺 Spesialis Fetomaternal</span>
        <span class="chip chip-pink">🔬 Laparoskopi (invasif)</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:14px; font-size:14px; color:var(--text-mid);">Deteksi dini → planning tatalaksana → menentukan kualitas hidup jangka panjang bayi.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════ BIBIR SUMBING ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="clp">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-icon icon-pink">👄</div>
      <div class="section-title">
        <small>Cleft Lip & Palate</small>
        Celah Bibir & Langit-langit (CLP)
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>🧬 Embriologi Wajah</h3>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-time">± 24 hari (minggu ke-3)</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Mulai pembentukan tonjolan maksila dan mandibula</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-time">5–6 minggu</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Muncul tonjolan hidung dan mulut (palatum)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-time">7–10 minggu ← FASE KRITIS ⚠️</div>
          <div class="tl-desc"><strong>Fusi</strong> antara tonjolan maksila dan hidung medial untuk membentuk wajah. Jika GAGAL → terbentuk celah (cleft)!</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box info-pink">
        <strong>Mekanisme:</strong> Bibir sumbing terjadi akibat kegagalan fusi tonjolan maksila dengan prosesus nasalis medial pada usia kehamilan 7–10 minggu.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>📝 Klasifikasi LAHSAL (Millard)</h3>
      <p style="font-size:14px; margin-bottom:14px; color:var(--text-mid);">Sistem paling sederhana & sering digunakan. Deskripsi dari <strong>kanan → kiri pasien</strong> (bukan pemeriksa!)</p>

      <div class="mnemonic-box">
        <div class="label">🌸 Mnemonic LAHSAL</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-big">L·A·H·S·A·L</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-items">
          <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>L</span> Lips (Bibir)</div>
          <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>A</span> Alveolus (Gusi)</div>
          <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>H</span> Hard Palate</div>
          <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>S</span> Soft Palate</div>
          <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>A</span> Alveolus Kiri</div>
          <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>L</span> Lips Kiri</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <table class="nice-table">
        <tr>
          <th>Notasi</th><th>Artinya</th>
        </tr>
        <tr><td><strong>L / A / H</strong> (huruf besar)</td><td>Celah <strong>komplit</strong> (seluruh bagian terkena)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>l / a / h</strong> (huruf kecil)</td><td>Celah <strong>inkomplit</strong> (hanya sebagian)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>–</strong> (strip)</td><td>Normal, tidak ada celah</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Contoh: <strong>LA–S–al</strong></td><td>Bibir & gusi kanan komplit, palatum lunak, gusi & bibir kiri inkomplit</td></tr>
      </table>

      <div class="info-box info-yellow">
        <strong>💡 Ingat:</strong> Celah bibir sumbing KIRI lebih sering daripada kanan. Bilateral bisa terjadi.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>🧬 Etiologi CLP</h3>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><strong>Herediter</strong>: 75% resesif, 25% dominan — mutasi gen spesifik, kelainan kromosom saat pembuahan zigot</li>
        <li>Usia kehamilan lanjut pada ibu</li>
        <li>Obat teratogenik saat kehamilan (mis. antikonvulsan, retinoid)</li>
        <li>Defisiensi nutrisi (as. folat!)</li>
        <li>Infeksi: Rubela, Sifilis</li>
        <li>Paparan radiasi, trauma awal kehamilan, stress psikis</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>⚠️ Komplikasi & Masalah Klinis</h3>
      <table class="nice-table">
        <tr><th>Masalah</th><th>Mekanisme</th></tr>
        <tr><td>🍼 Kesulitan minum ASI</td><td>Celah palatum → tidak bisa membuat tekanan negatif untuk menyusu</td></tr>
        <tr><td>👃 Suara sengau (nasal)</td><td>Komunikasi rongga mulut-hidung tidak sempurna</td></tr>
        <tr><td>👂 Tuli konduktif</td><td>Tuba Eustachii tidak terbentuk sempurna → gangguan tekanan telinga tengah</td></tr>
        <tr><td>😟 Masalah psikologis</td><td>Penampilan fisik berbeda → perlu dukungan keluarga & psikolog</td></tr>
        <tr><td>🦷 Maloklusi gigi</td><td>Celah alveolus mengganggu pertumbuhan gigi</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="cr-box" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">1</div>
        <div><strong>Curiga CLP:</strong> Neonatus dengan kesulitan minum ASI, suara sengau, tampak celah pada bibir/langit-langit</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">2</div>
        <div><strong>Klasifikasi:</strong> Deskripsikan menggunakan LAHSAL dari kanan → kiri pasien, tentukan komplit/inkomplit</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">3</div>
        <div><strong>Cari kelainan penyerta:</strong> Ingat, satu kelainan kongenital tidak berdiri sendiri — cek VACTERL!</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">4</div>
        <div><strong>Tatalaksana:</strong> Operasi sesuai "Rule of Ten"</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>🔟 Rule of Ten — Syarat Operasi CLP</h3>
      <div class="ten-grid">
        <div class="ten-card">
          <div class="ten-num">10</div>
          <div class="ten-label">Berat Badan<br>minimal 10 pounds (~4,5 kg)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ten-card">
          <div class="ten-num">10</div>
          <div class="ten-label">Hemoglobin<br>minimal 10 g/dL</div>
        </div>
        <div class="ten-card">
          <div class="ten-num">10</div>
          <div class="ten-label">Usia<br>minimal 10 minggu</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-box info-pink">
        <strong>⭐ SKDI Bibir Sumbing = 2</strong> (diagnosis + rujuk) <br>
        Jika berat badan belum 10 pons meski usia sudah lewat → TUNDA operasi, kejar nutrisi dulu. BB kurang → penyembuhan luka buruk.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════ MIKRO/MAKROGNATIA ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="mikro">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-icon icon-yellow">🦷</div>
      <div class="section-title">
        <small>Kelainan Mandibula</small>
        Mikrognatia & Makrognatia
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>🔍 Perbandingan Cepat</h3>
      <table class="nice-table">
        <tr><th></th><th>Mikrognatia</th><th>Makrognatia</th></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Definisi</strong></td><td>Rahang bawah (mandibula) <strong>terlalu kecil</strong>/hipoplasia</td><td>Rahang bawah <strong>terlalu besar</strong>/protuberansia berlebih</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Insidensi</strong></td><td>1 : 1.000 kelahiran</td><td>Lebih jarang (angka bervariasi)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Gigi</strong></td><td>Retrognasi, crowding</td><td>Malokusi kelas III (prognati)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Masalah utama</strong></td><td>Lidah jatuh ke belakang (glossoptosis) → Obstruksi napas!</td><td>Gigi depan bawah lebih maju dari atas</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Tatalaksana</strong></td><td>Mandibular distraction, ortopedi</td><td>Bedah ortognatik (osteotomi)</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>⚠️ Mikrognatia — Komplikasi Kritis</h3>
      <p style="font-size:14px; margin-bottom:14px;"><strong>Glossoptosis</strong> → uvula dan lidah terdorong ke atas/belakang → <strong>obstruksi jalan napas atas → BAHAYA!</strong></p>

      <div class="flow">
        <div class="flow-box">Mandibula kecil</div>
        <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="flow-box">Ruang oral sempit</div>
        <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="flow-box">Lidah jatuh ke posterior</div>
        <div class="flow-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="flow-box" style="background:#ffebee;border-color:#ef9a9a;">Obstruksi napas</div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box info-yellow">
        <strong>⭐ Pierre Robin Sequence:</strong> Triad klasik = Mikrognatia + Glossoptosis + Celah Palatum. Ingat ini!
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>📅 Mikrognatia — Terbentuk Kapan?</h3>
      <p style="font-size:14px; margin-bottom:10px; color:var(--text-mid);">Fase kritis: <strong>usia kehamilan 7–11 minggu</strong>. Obat teratogenik pada trimester I sangat berisiko.</p>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">Metotreksat</span>
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">Karbamazepin</span>
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">Asam Retinoat</span>
        <span class="chip chip-pink">Alkohol (FAS)</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:13px; margin-top:12px; color:var(--text-light);">Studi Harvard Medical School: dari 20 fetus mikrognatia prenatal, banyak yang memerlukan intervensi bedah post-natal.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════ ATRESIA ESOFAGUS ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="ea">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-icon icon-pink">🫁</div>
      <div class="section-title">
        <small>Esophageal Atresia / TEF</small>
        Atresia Esofagus & Fistula Trakeoesofagus
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>🧬 Embriologi — Mengapa Bisa Terjadi?</h3>

      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-time">Minggu ke-3 (22 hari)</div>
          <div class="tl-desc"><strong>Endoderm</strong> berdiferensiasi: bagian <strong>ventral</strong> → trakea (saluran napas), bagian <strong>dorsal</strong> → esofagus (saluran cerna)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-time">Minggu ke-4</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Divertikulum laringotrakea mulai terbentuk. Lipatan trakeoesofagus menyatu membentuk <strong>septum trakeoesofagus</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-item">
          <div class="tl-time">Minggu ke-4–5 ← FASE KRITIS</div>
          <div class="tl-desc">Jika <strong>septum menyimpang ke posterior</strong> → atresia esofagus dengan/tanpa fistula trakeoesofagus (TEF)</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box info-pink">
        <strong>Lapisan jaringan penting:</strong><br>
        🔴 Endoderm → organ dalam (usus, jantung, esofagus)<br>
        🟡 Mesoderm → tulang, otot<br>
        🔵 Ektoderm → saraf, otak, kulit
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>📊 Epidemiologi</h3>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">1 : 1.000–4.000 kelahiran hidup</span>
        <span class="chip chip-pink">♂ sedikit lebih sering (rasio 1,26:1)</span>
        <span class="chip chip-yellow">Risiko saudara kandung: 0,5–2%</span>
        <span class="chip chip-pink">Kembar: risiko 2,56× lebih tinggi</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size:14px; color:var(--text-mid);">Jika >1 anak terinfeksi dalam keluarga → risiko naik menjadi <strong>20%</strong>!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>🏷️ Klasifikasi Gross (A–E) — WAJIB HAFAL!</h3>
      <div class="tipe-grid">
        <div class="tipe-card">
          <div class="tipe-letter">A</div>
          <div class="tipe-name">EA Murni</div>
          <div class="tipe-pct">5–13%</div>
          <div class="tipe-desc">Tanpa fistula. Kedua ujung esofagus buntu.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tipe-card">
          <div class="tipe-letter">B</div>
          <div class="tipe-name">EA + Fistula Proksimal</div>
          <div class="tipe-pct">~1%</div>
          <div class="tipe-desc">Fistula di ujung proksimal esofagus ke trakea</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tipe-card" style="border-color:var(--pink-deep); background:#fff5f8;">
          <div class="tipe-letter" style="color:#d44;">C</div>
          <div class="tipe-name">EA + Fistula Distal</div>
          <div class="tipe-pct" style="color:#d44;">78–86%</div>
          <div class="tipe-desc">⭐ TERSERING! Fistula di ujung distal ke trakea</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tipe-card">
          <div class="tipe-letter">D</div>
          <div class="tipe-name">EA + Fistula Proks & Dist</div>
          <div class="tipe-pct">&lt;1%</div>
          <div class="tipe-desc">Dua fistula: proksimal dan distal</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tipe-card">
          <div class="tipe-letter">E</div>
          <div class="tipe-name">Fistula H (Tanpa EA)</div>
          <div class="tipe-pct">2–6%</div>
          <div class="tipe-desc">Fistula tipe-H. Tidak ada atresia esofagus.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <table class="nice-table" style="margin-top:16px;">
        <tr><th>Tipe</th><th>Prenatal (Polihidramnion?)</th><th>Klinis Post-natal</th></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>A</strong></td><td>✅ Ya (cairan amnion tidak tertelan)</td><td>Banyak saliva, sesak, sianosis saat minum</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>C</strong> ⭐</td><td>✅ Ya</td><td>Aspirasi → pneumonia, trakeomalasia</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>E</strong></td><td>❌ Tidak</td><td>Batuk berulang, pneumonia rekuren, baru terdiagnosis usia lebih besar</td></tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="cr-box">
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">1</div>
        <div><strong>Curiga prenatal:</strong> Polihidramnion pada USG → bayi tidak menelan cairan amnion → kemungkinan EA tipe A/C/D</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">2</div>
        <div><strong>Post-natal:</strong> Bayi baru lahir dengan hipersalivasi, muntah berbusa, sianosis/distres napas saat minum pertama kali</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">3</div>
        <div><strong>Konfirmasi diagnosis:</strong> Pasang NGT. Jika NGT mentok di tengah jalan (tidak sampai lambung) → curiga EA</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">4</div>
        <div><strong>Radiologi:</strong> Babygram (foto thorax + abdomen) — lihat posisi ujung NGT. NGT = radio-opak (putih). Ujung NGT tidak mencapai lambung → EA konfirmasi</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cr-step">
        <div class="cr-num">5</div>
        <div><strong>Cek VACTERL:</strong> Selalu cari kelainan penyerta!</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>🏥 Diagnosis & Tatalaksana</h3>
      <div class="dx-path">
        <div class="dx-step">
          <div class="dx-icon">🔬</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Pasang NGT</strong> — Ukur dari hidung → tragus → epigastrium. Jika NGT mentok di setengah jalan → <em>highly suspicious</em> EA
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dx-step">
          <div class="dx-icon">📸</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Babygram (Foto Polos)</strong> — Lihat posisi ujung NGT. Ingat: NGT = radio-opak (PUTIH). Normal: ujung NGT di bawah diafragma. EA: ujung NGT stuck di mediastinum
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dx-step">
          <div class="dx-icon">🏥</div>
          <div>
            <strong>Tatalaksana definitif:</strong> Operasi anastomosis esofagus (SKDI 3B — tatalaksana awal lalu rujuk spesialis bedah anak)
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box info-yellow">
        <strong>📖 Radiologi — Tabel Kilat:</strong><br>
        X-Ray: Putih = <strong>radio-opak</strong>, Hitam = <strong>radio-lusen</strong><br>
        CT Scan: Putih = <strong>hiperdens</strong>, Hitam = <strong>hipodens</strong><br>
        USG: Putih = <strong>hiperekogenik</strong>, Hitam = <strong>hipoekoik</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══════════════════════ VACTERL ══════════════════════ -->
  <div class="section" id="vacterl">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-icon icon-yellow">🔗</div>
      <div class="section-title">
        <small>Kelainan Penyerta</small>
        Asosiasi VACTERL
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>🌟 Prinsip EMAS Kelainan Kongenital</h3>
      <div class="info-box info-pink" style="font-size:16px; text-align:center; padding: 20px;">
        <strong>⭐ "Satu kelainan kongenital TIDAK PERNAH berdiri sendiri!"</strong><br>
        <span style="font-size:14px; color:var(--text-mid);">Selalu cari kelainan penyerta pada setiap pasien dengan kelainan kongenital</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mnemonic-box">
      <div class="label">🌸 Mnemonic VACTERL</div>
      <div class="mnemonic-big">VACTERL</div>
      <div class="mnemonic-items">
        <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>V</span> Vertebral anomaly (kelainan tulang belakang/skoliosis)</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>A</span> Anus (atresia ani / anus imperforata)</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>C</span> Cardiac (PJB — penyakit jantung bawaan)</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>T</span> Tracheo-Esophageal fistula</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>E</span> Esophageal atresia</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>R</span> Renal (kelainan ginjal)</div>
        <div class="mnemonic-item"><span>L</span> Limb (polidaktili / sindaktili)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-yellow">
      <h3>🩺 Cara Aplikasi Klinis</h3>
      <p style="font-size:14px; margin-bottom:14px; color:var(--text-mid);">Saat menemukan bayi dengan EA atau CLP:</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li><strong>V</strong>ertebra → Foto tulang belakang, ada skoliosis?</li>
        <li><strong>A</strong>nus → Inspeksi perineum, ada lubang anus? Patent?</li>
        <li><strong>C</strong>ardiac → Auskultasi, EKG/Echo, ada PJB?</li>
        <li><strong>T/E</strong> → Sudah diidentifikasi (EA/TEF)</li>
        <li><strong>R</strong>enal → USG ginjal, ada hidronefrosis/agenesis?</li>
        <li><strong>L</strong>imb → Hitung jari, ada polidaktili/sindaktili?</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card card-pink">
      <h3>📊 Ringkasan SKDI — Kelainan Kongenital Digestif</h3>
      <table class="nice-table">
        <tr><th>Penyakit</th><th>SKDI</th><th>Artinya</th></tr>
